        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "그 몇 톨도 네가 벌어 온 것이냐. 상 위에 떨어진 밥알까지 다 주워라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.youngest-child-cautious-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.youngest-child-cautious-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:start:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:start",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "서방님, 아이가 놀랐습니다. 제가 치우겠습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:start:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:start",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "감싸니 저 모양이지. 내 집 밥을 먹으면 밥 귀한 줄부터 알아야 하오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.youngest-child-cautious-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.youngest-child-cautious-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:start:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:start",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그때 대문 밖에서 기침 소리가 났다. 옹고집이 문을 열자 낯선 사내가 빈 그릇을 들고 서 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:review-main-003:start:6:audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:start:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:start",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "낯선 사내",
        "text": "사흘째 굶었습니다. 죽 한 그릇만 얻을 수 있겠습니까.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:start:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:start",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "서방님, 부엌에 남은 죽이 있습니다. 한 그릇만 내주시지요.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "flow": {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "cruelty-labor-first",
              "label": "“밥은 거저 못 준다. 장작부터 패라.”",
              "targetLineId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:0"
            },
            {
              "id": "cruelty-drive-away",
              "label": "“거지에게 내줄 밥은 없다. 썩 물러가라.”",
              "targetLineId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:0"
            }
          ]
        },
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "오래 함께 산 저 사람과 돌아가겠습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "사또",
        "text": "부인이 정한 사람은 가족과 집으로 돌아가라. 다른 한 사람은 관아 밖으로 물러나라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "또 다른 옹고집은 막내를 부인 곁으로 데려다주었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "막내가 “아버지!” 하고 불렀다. 또 다른 옹고집은 한 번 돌아본 뒤 관아 밖으로 걸어 나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "집으로 돌아온 뒤에도 막내는 부인 곁을 떠나지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "내가 돌아왔는데 왜 다들 고개만 숙이고 있느냐.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "아이들이 아직 놀랐습니다. 오늘 밤은 제가 아이들 곁에 있겠습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁, 둘째가 낮에 본 일을 말하려 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-hesitant-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-hesitant-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집이 둘째를 노려보자, 아이는 하려던 말을 그만두었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-hesitant-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:0"
        },
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-hesitant-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날, 옹고집은 국을 한 술 뜨자마자 목소리를 높였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "그 가짜 놈이 있을 때는 식은 국도 웃으며 먹었느냐. 이제 내 상 하나 제대로 못 차리는구나.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "막내가 울음을 참자 부인은 아이 쪽으로 갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "또 아이 편부터 드는 거요? 그놈이 며칠 다정한 척했다고 이 집 법도까지 바뀐 줄 아시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 뒤, 옹고집은 이웃 고을 장터에 다녀오겠다며 집을 나섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집이 집을 나서자 둘째는 며칠 전 못다 한 마당 이야기를 꺼냈다. 막내도 따라 웃었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁, 같은 얼굴의 사람이 예고 없이 돌아왔다. 아이들은 마루 끝으로 달려 나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "둘째",
        "text": "아버지, 오늘 마당에서 있었던 일도 이야기해도 돼요?",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "지난번 관아 판결을 잊으셨습니까. 다시 집에 들일 수는 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "또 다른 옹고집",
        "text": "눈발이 거세졌소. 날이 밝는 대로 떠날 테니 오늘 밤만 사랑채를 빌려 주시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "부인은 망설이다 사랑채만 내주었다. 아이들은 사랑채 문간에 앉아 낮에 본 일을 이야기했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "동틀 무렵, 또 다른 옹고집이 사랑채에서 나와 떠날 채비를 할 때 진짜 옹고집이 대문을 거칠게 열고 들어왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "분노한 옹고집",
        "text": "또 너냐! 감히 내 집과 처자식, 내 이름까지 다시 빼앗으려 드느냐!",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "이웃들이 다시 관아에 알렸고, 포졸들은 두 사람과 가족을 데려갔다. 사또가 묻기도 전에 옹고집이 먼저 소리쳤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "분노한 옹고집",
        "text": "사또 나리, 지난번에도 부인이 나와 돌아가겠다고 했습니다. 이번에는 더 물을 것도 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:15",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "사또",
        "text": "부인, 다시 묻겠다. 이번에는 누구와 집으로 돌아가겠느냐.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.magistrate-command-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.magistrate-command-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:16",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "막내는 또 다른 옹고집의 옷자락을 잡은 채 부인을 올려다봤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-01",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony:17",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "아이를 감싸 준 옹고집과 돌아간다",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
