      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "부인, 지금 누구를 보고 그런 말을 하는 거요.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "서방님인 것은 압니다. 하지만 아이들이 다시 당신 눈치만 보며 살게 할 수는 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-first-verdict",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "사또",
        "text": "부인이 정한 사람은 가족과 집으로 돌아가라. 다른 한 사람은 관아 밖으로 물러나라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.magistrate-command-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.magistrate-command-pixel"
            }
