      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "관아에서 쫓겨난 옹고집은 제 집으로 돌아갔다. 그러나 하인들은 사또의 판결을 들며 대문을 열지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.classic-shocked",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.classic-gate-outside",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.classic-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집은 거래하던 상인과 먼 친척까지 찾아갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "관아에서 가짜로 판정받았다는 소문이 먼저 퍼져, 누구도 그에게 밥이나 잠자리를 내주지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그 뒤로 얼마나 지났는지 옹고집은 알지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
