      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "내 집 문전에서 밥을 청해? 썩 물러가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "여인의 목소리",
        "text": "서방님, 저 사람 손이 다 터졌습니다. 죽 한 그릇만 내주면 안 되겠습니까.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "옹고집은 아내의 목소리를 알아듣고 입을 열었다가 아무 말도 하지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "그 손이 터진 게 내 탓이오? 문을 열면 이런 자들이 줄을 설 것이오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:15",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "밥은 거저 못 준다. 일할 힘이 남았으면 장작이나 패라. 다 패면 죽 한 그릇과 삯을 주겠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:16",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "낯익은 말이었지만, 그는 더 따질 수 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:17",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "옹고집은 대문 옆에 세워 둔 도끼자루를 집었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:18",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "밤이 깊도록 도끼질이 이어졌다. 젖은 장작은 쉽게 갈라지지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-03",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:19",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "나리, 장작을 다 팼습니다. 약속하신 죽과 삯을 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:20",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "문이 조금 열리고 하인이 죽 한 그릇을 내놓았다. 옹고집은 두 손으로 그릇을 받아 비웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:21",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "죽 한 그릇은 줬으니 됐다. 젖은 장작은 쓸 데가 없으니 삯은 반만 받고 물러가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:22",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "문틈으로 던진 엽전 몇 닢이 빈 죽그릇 옆으로 굴러왔다. 옹고집은 눈 위의 엽전을 주웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:23",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "문 안쪽에서 빈 그릇을 거두는 소리가 났다. 곧 빗장이 걸렸고, 마당은 다시 조용해졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        },
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:review-main-003:fake-route:23:audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:24",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "새벽녘, 옹고집이 걸음을 떼자 찢어진 짚신 사이로 눈이 들이쳤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:25",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "버리는 짚신이라도 좋습니다. 눈길을 걸을 것만 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:26",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "여인의 목소리",
        "text": "서방님, 헛간에 낡은 짚신이 한 켤레 있습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:27",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "낡은 것도 내 집 물건이오. 죽도 먹고 삯도 받았으면 됐지, 짚신까지 달라느냐. 썩 가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:28",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 29,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집은 젖은 짚신을 끌고 돌아섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:29",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 30,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "내가 남에게 한 그대로구나. 누굴 욕하겠느냐.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.classic-worn-reflection",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.classic-worn-reflection"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:30",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 31,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "몇 걸음 가지 못해 눈길에 주저앉았다. 뒤에서 빗장 거는 소리가 났다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route:31",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route",
        "order": 32,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "일어나지 못한 채 앉아 있을 때, 누군가 그의 앞에 주먹밥 두 개와 낡은 짚신을 내려놓았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-04",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
