      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-before-confession-days:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-before-confession-days",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집이 돌아온 지 한 달 가까이 되었다. 저녁이면 아이들은 화롯가로 와 낮에 있었던 일을 말했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          },
          "transition": {
            "durationMs": 450,
            "mode": "auto",
            "type": "fade-black"
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-before-confession-days:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-before-confession-days",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "요즘 들어 아이들이 많이 웃습니다. 저도 마음이 놓입니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:0"
        },
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 늦은 밤, 대문 밖에서 밥을 청하는 소리가 났다. 옹고집이 자리에서 일어났다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-resolve-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          },
          "transition": {
            "durationMs": 450,
            "mode": "auto",
            "type": "fade-black"
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-resolve-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "내가 나가 보겠소.",
        "leftAssetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "부인은 남은 죽을 데우러 갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "creative.character.onggojib-wife-tray",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "creative.character.onggojib-wife-tray"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집은 사내를 안으로 들였다. 부인이 죽을 내오는 동안, 젖은 신을 벗게 하고 아랫방에 자리를 폈다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-08",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "사내를 재운 뒤, 부인은 약상자를 가져왔다. 옹고집의 발에 난 상처는 아직 약을 더 발라야 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-09",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "상처가 좀처럼 아물지 않습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-concerned-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-concerned-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "부인, 할 말이 있소.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "말씀하십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-concerned-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-concerned-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "죽 한 그릇을 얻으려고 밤새 장작을 팼지만 삯은 반밖에 받지 못했소. 눈길을 걸을 짚신도 없었소.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "옹고집은 붕대를 감은 발을 내려다보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "나도 당신과 아이들, 집안사람들에게 모질게 굴었소.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-remorse-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:b-final-acts:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:b-final-acts",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "미안하오.",
        "leftAssetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-bowing",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
