      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "다 패면 죽 한 그릇과 삯을 주마.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "낯선 사내는 도끼를 들었다. 젖은 장작을 다 팰 때까지 밤이 깊었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "낯선 사내",
        "text": "나리, 장작을 다 팼습니다. 약속하신 죽과 삯을 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "하인이 죽 한 그릇을 내왔다. 사내는 얼어붙은 두 손으로 그릇을 받아 비웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "죽 한 그릇은 줬으니 됐다. 젖은 장작은 쓸 데가 없으니 삯은 반만 받고 물러가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "빈 죽그릇 옆으로 옹고집이 던진 엽전 몇 닢이 굴러왔다. 사내는 허리를 굽혀 눈 위의 엽전을 주웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "낯선 사내",
        "text": "버리는 짚신이라도 좋습니다. 눈길을 걸을 것만 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "서방님, 헛간에 낡은 짚신이 한 켤레 있습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "낡은 것도 내 집 물건이오. 죽도 먹고 삯도 받았으면 됐지, 짚신까지 달라느냐. 썩 가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집이 안방으로 들어간 뒤, 부인은 남편 몰래 길에서 먹을 주먹밥 두 개와 낡은 짚신을 대문 밖 처마 밑에 놓았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "날이 밝기 전, 사내는 주먹밥을 품에 넣고 낡은 짚신으로 갈아 신은 뒤 대문을 떠났다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날, 옹고집은 장사길에 오른다며 집을 나섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
