      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:23",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "둘째는 낮에 본 까치 이야기를 다 말했다. 막내도 옆에서 따라 웃었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:24",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 동안, 아이들은 그가 밥상에 앉아도 먼저 말을 꺼냈다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:25",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "일주일 뒤, 대문이 거칠게 열리고 눈발을 뒤집어쓴 남편이 뛰어 들어왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        },
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:25:audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "volume": 0.5
