        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "오래 함께 산 저 사람과 돌아가겠습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "사또",
        "text": "부인이 정한 사람은 가족과 집으로 돌아가라. 다른 한 사람은 관아 밖으로 물러나라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "또 다른 옹고집은 막내를 부인 곁으로 데려다주었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "막내가 “아버지!” 하고 불렀다. 또 다른 옹고집은 한 번 돌아본 뒤 관아 밖으로 걸어 나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.magistrate-yard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "집으로 돌아온 뒤에도 막내는 부인 곁을 떠나지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "내가 돌아왔는데 왜 다들 고개만 숙이고 있느냐.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
