        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-hesitant-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날, 옹고집은 국을 한 술 뜨자마자 목소리를 높였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "그 가짜 놈이 있을 때는 식은 국도 웃으며 먹었느냐. 이제 내 상 하나 제대로 못 차리는구나.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "막내가 울음을 참자 부인은 아이 쪽으로 갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "또 아이 편부터 드는 거요? 그놈이 며칠 다정한 척했다고 이 집 법도까지 바뀐 줄 아시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 뒤, 옹고집은 이웃 고을 장터에 다녀오겠다며 집을 나섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "creative.character.onggojib-real-walking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집이 집을 나서자 둘째는 며칠 전 못다 한 마당 이야기를 꺼냈다. 막내도 따라 웃었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁, 같은 얼굴의 사람이 예고 없이 돌아왔다. 아이들은 마루 끝으로 달려 나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "둘째",
        "text": "아버지, 오늘 마당에서 있었던 일도 이야기해도 돼요?",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "부인",
        "text": "지난번 관아 판결을 잊으셨습니까. 다시 집에 들일 수는 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "또 다른 옹고집",
        "text": "눈발이 거세졌소. 날이 밝는 대로 떠날 테니 오늘 밤만 사랑채를 빌려 주시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.second-child-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "부인은 망설이다 사랑채만 내주었다. 아이들은 사랑채 문간에 앉아 낮에 본 일을 이야기했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.warm-room-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.wife-resolved-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "동틀 무렵, 또 다른 옹고집이 사랑채에서 나와 떠날 채비를 할 때 진짜 옹고집이 대문을 거칠게 열고 들어왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "분노한 옹고집",
        "text": "또 너냐! 감히 내 집과 처자식, 내 이름까지 다시 빼앗으려 드느냐!",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.double-blue-gentle-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:real-loop-testimony-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "이웃들이 다시 관아에 알렸고, 포졸들은 두 사람과 가족을 데려갔다. 사또가 묻기도 전에 옹고집이 먼저 소리쳤다.",
