          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "관아에서 쫓겨난 옹고집은 제 집으로 돌아갔다. 그러나 하인들은 사또의 판결을 들며 대문을 열지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.classic-shocked",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.classic-gate-outside",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.classic-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그 뒤로 얼마나 지났는지 옹고집은 알지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "주막 행랑과 남의 헛간을 전전하는 동안 끼니를 거르는 날이 이어졌고, 갈아입지 못한 옷과 짚신도 해져 갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "눈발이 거세 집 모양도 제대로 보이지 않았다. 옹고집이 큰 대문을 두드리자 누군가 문틈으로 내다보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-02",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
