        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "옹고집은 대문 옆에 세워 둔 도끼자루를 집었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "밤이 깊도록 도끼질이 이어졌다. 젖은 장작은 쉽게 갈라지지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.scene.shortstory-knolstory-03",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "나리, 장작을 다 팼습니다. 약속하신 죽과 삯을 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
