        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "문이 조금 열리고 하인이 죽 한 그릇을 내놓았다. 옹고집은 두 손으로 그릇을 받아 비웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.snow-village-road-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "죽 한 그릇은 줬으니 됐다. 젖은 장작은 쓸 데가 없으니 삯은 반만 받고 물러가라.",
