        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "문틈으로 던진 엽전 몇 닢이 빈 죽그릇 옆으로 굴러왔다. 옹고집은 눈 위의 엽전을 주웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:16",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "새벽녘, 옹고집이 걸음을 떼자 찢어진 짚신 사이로 눈이 들이쳤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:17",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "버리는 짚신이라도 좋습니다. 눈길을 걸을 것만 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-pleading-v2-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:18",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "여인의 목소리",
        "text": "서방님, 헛간에 낡은 짚신이 한 켤레 있습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:19",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "문 안의 사내",
        "text": "낡은 것도 내 집 물건이오. 죽도 먹고 삯도 받았으면 됐지, 짚신까지 달라느냐. 썩 가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty:20",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:fake-route-cruelty-labor-first__work-promised__wage-wet-wood__shoe-poverty",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옹고집은 젖은 짚신을 끌고 돌아섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-exiled-consistent-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
