      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "낯선 사내",
        "text": "거저 달라는 뜻은 아닙니다. 시킬 일이 있으면 하겠습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "그럼 저 젖은 장작을 다 패라. 끝내기 전에는 죽도 없다. 다 패면 죽 한 그릇과 삯을 주마.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "낯선 사내는 도끼를 들었다. 젖은 장작을 다 팰 때까지 밤이 깊었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "낯선 사내",
        "text": "나리, 장작을 다 팼습니다. 약속하신 죽과 삯을 주십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "하인이 죽 한 그릇을 내왔다. 사내는 얼어붙은 두 손으로 그릇을 받아 비웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "옹고집",
        "text": "죽 한 그릇은 줬으니 됐다. 도끼질이 느려 밤이 다 갔으니 삯은 반만 받고 물러가라.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-003:part1-court-cruelty-drive-away__work-no-food__wage-too-slow__shoe-crawl",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "빈 죽그릇 옆으로 옹고집이 던진 엽전 몇 닢이 굴러왔다. 사내는 허리를 굽혀 눈 위의 엽전을 주웠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "onggojib.character.real-angry-pixel",
        "rightAssetId": "onggojib.character.stranger-hidden-pixel",
        "backgroundId": "onggojib.background.winter-courtyard-pixel",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "presentation": {
          "actors": {
            "left": {
              "emphasis": "dim",
              "facing": "right"
            },
            "right": {
              "facing": "right",
              "scaleMultiplier": 0.98
            }
